        "notes": "ROUND 1\nPower: Wraith Renewal\n\nPercs: Compensator\nWeapon Grease\nArmored Vest\n\nNotes:\nNo lifesteal? You read that right. D.Va will be matrixing most of your shots, so lifesteal is NOT worth investing into at the start, unlike some other builds. If you teleport into the backline, MAKE SURE you can make it back to your team with wraith form. Whenver you int, D.Va will dive you, so be prepared to wraith out when you're low. Other than that, play how you normally would, just try to stay alive as long as possible to make money.",
