        "notes": "ROUND 2\nPercs:\nPhantasmic Flux\nCompensator\n\nNotes: Typically in games against D.Va, you won't have that much money since she'll be eating all your shots and preventing you from killing the enemy backline. So on average you should have 10-11k. Phantasmic Flux is simply the strongest all-round option for Reaper in round 2, which is why you see it in so many builds. I like to add extra WP if I have the cash, but besides Flux, you can take whatever you prefer - just remember that WP is very important for securing kills in the windows where defense matrix is down.",
