        "notes": "ROUND 3\nPower: Spirited to Slay\n\nPercs:\nPhantasmic Flux\nTalon Modification Module\nShieldbuster\nCompensator\nOR:\nPhantasmic Flux\nDauntless Draught\nCompensator\n\nNotes: Take the first set of percs if you are able to get elims and take out the enemy dps/backline OR take the second set if survivability is a problem against the D.Va and her team. By this point you should have roughly 21k. \n\nPersonally, for Reaper, I like having at least 30% WP at round 3. Having Spirited to Slay means you can be MUCH more aggressive. The core gameplay loop becomes: Look for kills - secure the kill- wraith to heal or escape - repeat. Ignore the enemy D.Va unless your tank is absolutely dominating her, in which case you should help kill her as quickly as possible. Otherwise, focus on eliminating enemy DPS and supports.",
