        "notes": "ROUND 4\nPercs:\nPhantasmic Flux\nDauntless Draught\nTalon Modification Module\nCompensator\n\nNotes:\nIn round 4, 30% WP is still solid for dueling enemy DPS and supports. So now, you'll want to take Dauntless Draught to reach full potential for wraith form. Whenever you wraith, healing shouldn't be an issue. And everytime you secure a kill, you can wraith again. This lets you be aggressive and defensive when both are necessary. Just remember to pay attention to what your team is doing, and always wraith back to them when you can't secure a kill to reset the cooldown.",
