        "notes": "ROUND 5\nPower: Shrouded Shrapnel\n\nPercs:\nPhantasmic Flux\nDauntless Draught\nCodebreaker*\nTalon Modification Module\nCompensator\n\nNotes: By now, the amount of cash you have will vary a lot. You might have thousands more than what is shown here, but remember to focus on WP. For powers, Shrouded Shrapnel, Revolving Ruin, and Strangle Step are all good options. For the latter two, check the notes for each power to see when you should take them. Personally, I prefer Shrouded Shrapnel because of how well it pairs with Spirited to Slay. If you are constantly using wraith form, then EVERY magazine you have will have more pellets, more spread, and more damage. \n\nFor percs, Codebreaker is always a solid pick but it is epsecially good if you want to start putting more pressure on the enemy D.Va. If armor isn't a problem for you, then try to get Eye of the Spider for higher WP. Securing kills on DPS and supports is always the goal against good D.Va's. Vanadium Injection is also always a good option if you never plan to use death blossom. Personally, I only use my ult if I can finish off an annoying high mobility character like Genji, Lucio, or Mercy.",
