        "notes": "ROUND 6\nNotes:\nCongratulations! If you reach round 6, your game probably isn't going too well. If survivability is a problem, play closer to your tank and around areas you can hide if you need to use wraith form. For percs, pick up Eye of the Spider if you have enough money to reach 70% WP. Vanadium Injection is always a good option. Optionally, you can take Aerial Distresser if you're against a good Genji, Freja, Mercy, Lucio, or Juno. For the later rounds, you'll need high WP to punch through the bullsh*t overhealth percs that the enemy supports probably have. Flank and get picks when you see an opportunity, otherwise, brawl and try to stop their D.Va from diving too far.",
